{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1334,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda2f34e7706d8ea70c7b90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サンマって、骨がたくさんあって\r\n食べにくい～！も～、骨取って！\r\nじゃないと食べないからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58da7ba95f81b340b50409ab40f52e482bb663f048e39211ff3af8ca8e226fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644fd93b9117b48469b2a924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そうだ！アンタも、素敵なお洋服を\r\nサンタに頼みなさい！お揃いのほう\r\nが、魔女と使い魔っぽいでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b788ea2144610177c13e3e979f611186253e6abea494527ef689aa7d7802ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d35d075c92e6af7e6d9d22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふん♪素敵でしょ、このドレス！\r\nどう思った？…魔女みたい？\r\nほら、もっといっぱいほめなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03089cc5d9cd0c72b9d669a000ec2fb6130bfaad7b5dc3214fa6c5bda171e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a4589f9f50bbc7ba849ea26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これを着ると魔力がすっごくアップ\r\nするのよ！試しに…ビリア☆\r\nブーゲン！アタシの虜になぁれ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c94c6213aefd812c7a0ac31ae02fff0eda39ca09a04b6c2562bbc6e9054fbb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e6e42bd31c12f29cb34358c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真的是魔法修行吗？\r\n如果你敢骗我，\r\n我绝对不会放过你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f48d7f67fd3296b55f1fd8f8b45d11856c8a9544e85f96874cbc1281a75d515",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f065dc9f8023a262f16a0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってやるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b239c08597c143b968b7a7f6745d09ff8a99fa7fd96a961465ac4ce8293cce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b1d0de332f4150208c9bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果很开心我就会奉陪。\r\n但我腻了就会回去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f2d4b8ec50ac1aca7975e4102c69815f7bbb4f70feb970baa8bcc3d7de373a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a0b30748a3eca3d2548723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "异果异果・异果菊☆\r\n哼哼～这样就准备万全了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5567bd3f2a2726728065d6a373edf2ec984ec618800ad5d55cac7afa2cde542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c338c20cafb1e69d3940e18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是天才魔法少女。\r\n我很快就会把训练全部做完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c68c403d6fe4f49bdf5f8684023fc10ad032f388ecfbbd4a485eac2b5b937aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dba392696f59f15543ec8e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近好像开始觉得跑步很开心了。\r\n说不定我离成为魔女\r\n又更近一步了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f014972967ee8498d50a099ac68dd87d44ed5770676298cf813a2cbd44ba8358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e30f481b4ef858ac22328a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然你都这样拜托我了，\r\n那我就稍微努力一下吧！\r\n你要感谢我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c8c009d76b03fb22a89b92f7e38f1f5f784b1cf02522ea26664d227d8c6730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6227e4e8d84e63d6ddd89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也配合你训练吧！\r\n你要一直称赞我，\r\n给我很多奖励喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "882df8c01d19e99e8a213290638f3813d31f4cae3392c9849bc7fb3ad3b4d8d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7e8b95f116783da328b8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌讨厌～！\r\nSweepy想去海边玩！\r\n去──海──边──啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e97ca826901b811d86a88a5498bc6bb3165d35de50eb373f88eb5facb8450f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d25dbc4d6c7cc2853f4706c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニング、ちゃーんと\r\n見てなさい？まばたきなんか\r\nしてたら、見逃しちゃうんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b28bdbd17cdbfea9a242991b40bc33a6da7343550d678e803b7b47a10f86711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af192ac5416e8dba68da4e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はこれでトレーニングするから\r\n服が汚れないメニューにしなさい！\r\nちょっとでも汚れたら怒るからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde2d3500d2c6c46a1d35feef695a39cb6b1c24bf761132c66d375dc488edc8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6133e419739e62b08eb70b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このドレスの力で、もっともーっと\r\n大きい魔法が使えるはず！\r\nさあ、試すわよ使い魔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c655e4ba2c30c336c4608c57369093d62b5abf0bbc177eb9e519374c1a65347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e05c97803ba16ae465209c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あとで甘い飲みもの買って！あと、\r\nお菓子も！…約束できる？なら、\r\nやる気を出してあげてもいいわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "323a8802979dd4cabd952a2ba5da57cb39a7d71f8880a91de92c30e16007cf90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90f075f55d333d0b64803ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つまんないもの、ぜんぶ\r\n変えてやるわ！魔法って、\r\nそのためにあるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b34a5741ca006a400354cdffa39e1c96c3aa6d2d98c714256d56a09ea807180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d973355abf2977414cf819d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔、なんかアドバイスある？\r\nどーしようもない意見だったら\r\n聞いてなんてあげないけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ab4f65348e6c843163b3bc0074a48b3dc94b4ce54f4a8c8926fb54efc6dfed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc1f8c31870b65d638c06a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタはずっと、アタシに尽くし\r\nなさい！そしたら、アタシも――\r\nちょっとは、期待に応えてあげる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbaa6ede9cfe54aca6ad4670355b5dfad15ecb10041736e5bd0fbc4524968f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b8505b6df98ad758dd5f7a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你变得可靠了呢。身为我的使魔，\r\n这是理所当然的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b4701972c53c234883c6714dbc37c5c0f42d0d3baee60b17ff751c59605e802",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f859b92ee5ba1f9ba7eb617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今后也要好好看Sweepy\r\n大显身手！知道了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ee6c0083fb3da46d546e325a10924c602e68e67ba9582c31c4edf3e4f73b3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6988d734fe45c4e735b4260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからもずっと、隣にいなさい！\r\nこれは命令だからねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1099baa1aba8309289636b8fafc5b394843914aa33b1e76375631983db3531e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fbebfe021ea4fc946acb761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタも、ちょっとは使い魔らしく\r\nなったんじゃない？ちょっとだけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12babec7896ba4a9e3aab366a65da2dbe21e4d9d0f0099102a99f379d29b90cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f8cbd880af79a94827b746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉魔力提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd2f8d453cd24cf19a5cd5e3efc82538a85708151372e4b700d88368731385d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f71501833a2b09e985130c80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究极魔法・花朵盛开！\r\n绽放吧，天赋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a610b082ace3f6cb38c8a617a67894ff71b16b40c6966da303439b041256f4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7137bcab18d3d67e2fccc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是天才魔法少女东商变革！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea1fd5a03efabf6d35e863dc44b67e9b9ae8966155aeab4e321d0d740edd01d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad7c58f6293a463ad90db24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\n我会让你见识到厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b79d048f9b0789d01411bdf11682745f87ab10816fcffff4b2fbe2e5bfa2b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a705997b92cee9286a10ef18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辅助魔法就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc470815415f5637dc78f34445d699e8eb1784b48e32bbfce3655c42cb86753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1352407f2e0830a4da6e44f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来是时候使用秘术了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "109c18b8596a37ceed913b8a8eaf5f17eb60017a9b711c572bcf700aec4e92df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e81fa4ca7823971e98b33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成長したアタシに、祝福の鐘を鳴らしなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fe02dc0eca4d377e606836f0626f19eb50fa70856f2a4493cd168b151014e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea001346ac45d14596b9b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔女としての、新たな門出ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd358c58f5d54b0899dce870b4231148695d43d5352bafbc0237325366c5bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b000114a475945dab73e05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら！さっさとエスコートして！\r\n特別な魔法、見つけに行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab88b055ab290ac1844d2a5252897e88ca7132bbf77ae49be1065132e048783b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b70b7f627a80b6cbfa7185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スイープトウショウよ！\r\nしっかりついてきなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e43ab116f8f88c27969542fed5ec8adf47a8c5aaa1c77d1670feb4b7a5c9090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bd045913089e6b352e2367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要为我加油哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d752149f017c02cb05b0d2cf683f295b0f3c33b194cd4f725459d03f661e83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5648ff3cf3756d61a48f6d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，你一定能成为\r\n很了不起的训练员的。\r\n……我的直觉算是蛮准的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ecd3947396dde38d35c7cbf6370215c2115ece82782e9267daac6bc7bbc3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a688b1f3d6d67c8bebad0bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきますね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96d14d41756bc31913d185718019d646d025c1f2641ac0b41d828a17930ff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e2d69b605f96f6f2630493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1819a5f4c012a54f288e2c49a94fb4a80a14213f846aac1204b77a584a18e38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fad06692803057f7e921ea2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，累的话可以\r\n靠在我身上也没关系。\r\n我们一起互相扶持吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f33fa85dd4f1f1e730c65922acf9f06b8b55c6c0b83e6462450db27e7c678cfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6584754addc930eb816fd4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，训练员愿意依赖我……\r\n这对我来说就是种宠爱哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c58d22904d4533243cc3b9392537fcec4dbfd9e95a55cee2efbf1edc178782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d41ac38798fe59dc452050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年我会努力比去年\r\n更加溺爱你的哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d826c7292010c3e348e94d405257e35d1002bd7c78460cfeed2726e8602b24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77282c0c647ce3d285711253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "送给努力的训练员巧克力♪\r\n累的时候吃甜食最棒了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "473b09585cdb2e2a3205c07549a8e2e2fa8c12fdd7b5f79e3ba32df750314d24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e29d2a62e8832c4eba48474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想看训练员的笑容，\r\n我做了巧克力哦。\r\n呵呵呵，让我来喂你吃吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1044eda7cc33d5f208254a5a56bd4a1c05f5208f6a275ca11a8ae0312db4181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2144de20a9ea771a539dcd8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……希望训练员的愿望可以实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "261828d95ba0da01325284654d67903bda45e6eb5da3207e358e0c044c9d2374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d3a41425659d4b3ad0fbc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有准备好万圣节的点心哦……\r\n呵呵，你也可以对我恶作剧哦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2aaf7b88cd30be84697132744fc8586bebd58eef3d71eafc514ffa5a45d552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2721874442263fb27cb24063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐♪\r\n因为训练员是好孩子，\r\n所以圣诞老人也一定会来的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e263dd2d33697e623929260b4d7dbd0f88471d2c412eb1d242a61889031dd331",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0554d3dc283f54849c7862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就由我来扮圣诞老人，\r\n献给训练员一个美好的圣诞夜\r\n当礼物吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c89fe105f2018bc01ea1731bf2ffec1a36984445e7f029c9ecc6b540d0759dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d2750a408adff0d3af0a3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都笑得很开心呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "057456e58705fde872c5e233883e0ff18e8cd8523bc952c1e8a8daf05ad639d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27712039cf8e6be50a51f710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要整理到亮晶晶的哦～\r\n好好打扫干净来迎接新年吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eec1f698ad59bbe5a5f9393cf05e5ba8cd07dabf193ce25820acea8fd767737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299d09593196cf38c26900d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，训练员。\r\n我来为你唱生日快乐歌吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e422908f6ed2b43f9c14ace183c4abaf0026b63da7a16e3f77a4631bb82f179d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b67ff8642cb8ea22fafaee0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天是你的生日……呵呵，\r\n所以今天我要更加溺爱你哦～♪\r\n看招看招。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ace32f1b35020254f599ef50124afc8b9c559f2cd3c21526a42f7680047782fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be4fcdfbb4b210150640b72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都帮我庆生……\r\n因为太开心，胸口附近\r\n都变得热呼呼的了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd35e3d1b724ec9252634dad1cc1f578f71089f5a100f2e5f28593d97e962c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf496e8f4d633611c5a57d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……竟然会来帮我庆生……\r\n怎么办呢？因为太开心，\r\n都想抱住你了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1e57ee841bb3dab2eb6902bf42d0105428c1a2d49b4f85e5ba4fa48d7c149a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e041c11507ab66cecdef554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～好像收到新公告了。\r\n我们一起看吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4c2ecf57213162657b929b3cd05489eb9fdfa2eba458ec1bfeb2562ab687d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eafc66ca7b20e0de61c5d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，真好。\r\n好像有礼物送来了呢～\r\n呵呵呵，会是谁送的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41eb605e94423f4f4e31630c1d54f44f2d2e64c2ba7725fa43cca94d754aad33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be9a0646118e46fa6874792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜你达成目标了！\r\n真不愧是训练员，好棒好棒哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6f0eacde9b239d1ac5efdfe1401003ad9a42478bdb7814cb7afe63ce200786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ad120072d66aa5ee87a31c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……好像快要举办活动了。\r\n希望我们能一起参加呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "40f338afb8701ecd1e08696966a28348a036ee6b7d75803d8c5f742094c304dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a205bfcabed8e25b93f8b2b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是因为正在举办活动的关系，\r\n都听得见大家欢笑的声音呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b03e39fef7348d65c9e03d1ef089bafc008ab22d3fb35b1f8d52d306ae6d936f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a5bc43b4c4bbc1807398398",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "331b323896afa94e0d2457dd00db0f089cda7de4dfdf0c01c1bb806d02ab979a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5d0111a43754a99767ca56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了哦～\r\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4981ef5903ef848f467b310a582c148ed1e3e26987f1652d4fd88745a885ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7186b8f083ed5e0242d01e6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的布料很柔软，\r\n抱抱时大家就会立刻熟睡♪\r\n训练员，你要不要试试看呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "971828ada9ad593a4204bdc57d056d5183a4c24a11bc6e5ab66bb09afc1e854f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bc023808e7886ee3ffb56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的画风果然很可怕吗？\r\n我自认为画的是可爱动物，\r\n却被别人说很惊悚～",
      "source_fingerprint": "752ae65c19583855f6b90cf1c3d4540eda559e83a5581cfe99eb6be21b024388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6325b791d9c4f850a662a3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我悄悄拍下小进的\r\n照片……结果挨骂了。她缩成一团的\r\n睡相很可爱，我就忍不住拍下来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a905e78efa15a6752cb91a0629e53466b3da20f1f11917b47d07698c00460035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17af88bdbc7587d3f0fa708",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都尽力了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e61c44cb1e37747d7f9df73e527c9bb3ca5c8f3d57287d7cfafb67853d8106e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98092fa0c208f9da84aaea4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是大家一起努力的成果呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "765eb8830de78f0a3a97b1470071286cf9fa2e25e934e694fa03a0cc4e1226c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94455f21c9bec7ffd6a48438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "331b323896afa94e0d2457dd00db0f089cda7de4dfdf0c01c1bb806d02ab979a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32bc36338fcc8ca2d437e90d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都尽力了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e61c44cb1e37747d7f9df73e527c9bb3ca5c8f3d57287d7cfafb67853d8106e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f734cbc9224b44d266afc570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新最高分了，好孩子好孩子～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "481122226a0652439c2c76e8603b7558e29173b2fa36580cb53306004f78e1e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b274c28fd5603562e8e6c418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不用紧张也没关系的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4110917de7fd509aaa02c22af7d3143cb4c9ae7c9ad13207ae32e8f04fb76c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d07c426d9945ebc41f80a78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我该说的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d7cf9904148f0c111a59ff8c965972c89090a61c00b7d57c142817f08ec9044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d71d8980da02adfdc384899",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在前往的路上一直牵着手……",
      "source_fingerprint": "302403c97faecde894213a7972bc1acf142f93e77000891265dd9999cdd19da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d206bbe451a12f326282eb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧紧抱一下来消除紧张……",
      "source_fingerprint": "befed334c42b5cdd2ec3e6e993d9f2b9c36339be054d465fc22bcb348c03f6d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
